# scripts/opcount: `processbench bench timed N` runs N process.Run of a
# small block under a time limit of an hour; the cost of one is the slope
# between the two sizes (PROCESS-RUN), against hand Go (goroutine,
# recover, context.WithTimeout).
unit run
sizes 100000 1100000
args bench timed {n}
control benchmarks/process/testdata/control
binary processbench
